和合并用药分别采用MedDRA和WHO Drug词典编码。安全性分析集包括所有至少接受一次研究药物（合成药X或安慰剂）给药的随机受试者，按实际接受的治疗分组。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"TP-MA-07 v2.0 body-child 795,796\"}]}],\"notes\":[]}},{\"block_id\":\"block:v2_n_11_4_5:005\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"安全性数据以描述性统计为主，不进行正式假设检验。不良事件按治疗组汇总发生例数、发生率、严重程度、与药物的相关性、导致停药的情况，并按MedDRA系统器官分类和首选术语分层。连续变量报告例数、均值、标准差、中位数、最小值和最大值，以及较基线的变化；分类变量报告频数和百分比。注射部位反应按预先定义的类别汇总；严重不良事件单独列表。\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"source_locator\":\"TP-MA-07 v2.0 body-child 795,796\"},{\"block_id\":\"block:v2_n_11_4_5:006\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"安全性数据来源于不良事件记录、严重不良事件记录、生命体征、体格检查、实验室检查、12导联心电图、注射部位评估和合并用药记录。不良事件和合并用药分别采用MedDRA和WHO Drug词典编码。\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"source_locator\":\"TP-MA-07 v2.0 body-child 795,796\"}]}","receipt":{"idempotency_key":"chapter-draft.generate.v1","input_artifacts":[{"ref":"chapter-intake","sha256":"f08e257f89bb575297e19d995df21440d004235c6b984e183e1e9e2f2226ba1c"}],"logical_call_id":"call:chapter-draft:f3c582a495d6798f54ccf3edb5ac2243c83c360d5a4404d88279e47e3b82bb60:chapter-generate","node_execution_contract_id":"nec:chapter-draft:f3c582a495d6798f54ccf3edb5ac2243c83c360d5a4404d88279e47e3b82bb60:chapter-generate","observed_model":"deepseek-flash","observed_provider":"deepseek","output_schema_ref":"https://protocol-v3.local/schemas/ordered-chapter-draft-candidate.v1.json","output_sha256":"91b02098193812330ed8b1a3fd1390188fe734c20daa1de457e4aba8bc02fcd3","prompt_sha256":"47dd66c834319411962b91127cd952207cccdab4dee7068a9ab81409e5aefa1e","provider_session_id":"b87e30b0-fc18-482c-8556-8a193869ddd8","requested_reasoning_effort":"max"},"schema":"model_response.v1"}